<title>POLAND: BANK GDANSKI NOV NET FALLS TO PLN 4.95 MLN.</title>
<headline>BANK GDANSKI NOV NET FALLS TO PLN 4.95 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results November</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit					  4.95 vs    6.81</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   10.95 vs   10.42</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 36.30 vs   30.88</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	64.06 vs    0.06</p>
<p>JANUARY-NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit					 89.19 vs   99.67</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				  149.53 vs  180.64</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		363.85 vs  317.03</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues     672.41 vs  588.00</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Bank Gdanski SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
